    // fallback happened to give the right answer. It is now listed explicitly in
    // INPUT_NEEDED_NOTIFICATION_TYPES, so this test pins the intent rather than the
    // coincidence. Keeping both this and `notification_agent_completed_is_a_noop` is
    // what makes the pair's OPPOSITE classification the asserted property.
    assert_eq!(
